{"synopsis":"Ketika kegelapan menyerang kota, milyaran pejuang manusia muncul, tetapi Aiden bukan salah satu dari mereka. Suatu hari, dia menemukan sebuah cincin misterius dan dikirim ke Alam Orc di mana manusia dilarang, oleh sebuah perjanjian. Secara ajaib dia selamat dari eksekusi, mengangkat palu suci Suku Orc, dan menjadi pemimpin suku. Saat itu juga, dia dibawa kembali ke dunia asalnya.","alternative_title":"神戒降临，最强异世界, Divine Ring Descends: The Strongest in Another World, Become the Strongest Hero Through the Cheat System, Shénjiè Jiànglín, Zuìqiáng Yìshìjiè, The Divine Ring Descends: The Strongest Otherworld, Shenjie Jianglin, Zuiqiang Yishijie","author":"Heiniao She","artist":"Heiniao She","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"9177a682-1f01-440d-b21a-a5a6588b2fe7","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"","date":"2026-02-10","released":"2026-02-10"},{"chapter_id":"51da9d86-d2d5-4689-b537-4d16bedf7d1e","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"","date":"2026-02-10","released":"2026-02-10"},{"chapter_id":"89f8572c-ae9e-452b-96d2-ea6a8be938cf","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"","date":"2026-02-10","released":"2026-02-10"},{"chapter_id":"71a157f6-3a8e-4c8f-a280-94f39672d8fa","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2026-02-01","released":"2026-02-01"},{"chapter_id":"1d9421a4-0594-4acd-a5fa-0844f80e3f61","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28"},{"chapter_id":"c6ca3b03-0a4e-4bc2-a32a-ad0da725872b","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28"},{"chapter_id":"82755424-f05d-4a14-8a2b-b8816ad90ef9","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"","date":"2026-01-16","released":"2026-01-16"},{"chapter_id":"0a58e48a-0b63-4daf-a8ed-cde5034e060d","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"","date":"2026-01-16","released":"2026-01-16"},{"chapter_id":"e0a8f2ad-1b58-485d-b322-756850923e9e","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"","date":"2026-01-16","released":"2026-01-16"},{"chapter_id":"aa5e107d-33ed-453c-aa